[00:48.68]1. “Listen to my prayer,” Jehovah.
[00:58.24]Let yourself be found by me.
[01:08.04]Feel the anguish deep inside me;
[01:13.94]Help me unafraid to be.
[01:20.14](Chorus)
[01:23.42]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[01:29.82]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[01:36.66]He will always give protection.
[01:43.50]He is loyal; he is true.
[01:52.80]2. Had I wings just as a dove has,
[01:58.82]Far from danger I would fly,
[02:04.22]Safe from those who seek to hurt me,
[02:10.54]Sheltered from their hateful cry.
[02:17.46](Chorus)
[02:19.26]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[02:19.44]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[02:19.44]He will always give protection.
[02:19.44]He is loyal; he is true.
[02:21.18]3. Comfort from our God, Jehovah,
[02:21.18]Always brings us peace of mind.
[02:21.18]He will help us bear our burden.
[02:21.18]He is loving; he is kind.
[02:21.18](Chorus)
[02:21.18]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[02:27.38]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[02:34.78]He will always give protection.
[02:39.80]He is loyal; he is true.
